      ],
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Service Tax (Amendment) Bill 2001"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Service Tax (Amendment) Act"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2001. Amendment of section 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 36. Service Tax (Amendment) 7 New section 37A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 37 the following section: \" Obligation 37A. ( 1) Except as provided under section 38, the name of secrecy and address of an informer and the substance of the information received from an informer shall be kept secret and shall not be disclosed by any proper officer or any person who in the ordinary course of his duties comes into possession of or has control of or access to such information to any person except the designated proper officer authorized by the Director General. (2) Any person who contravenes subsection (1) shall be guilty of an offence against this Act and shall be liable on conviction to a fine not exceeding ten thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both.\". Amendment of section 41"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 4 1( c c) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the word \"invoices\" the words \"or receipts\". Amendment of section 46"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_13",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "13",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 46(2)(a) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words \"firm or association of persons\" the words \"a firm, a society, an association or other body of persons\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Service Tax Act 1975 [Act 151], which in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in section 2—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1) of that section;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the definition of \"person\", by substituting for the words \"an association of persons\" the words \"a society, an association\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_1__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the definition of \"exported taxable service\" the following definition: ' \"exported taxable service\"—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in relation to the provision of insurance policies for the coverage of the international transportation of goods, means where the insurance policies are provided to cover risks relating to the transportation of goods—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "from a place outside Malaysia to a place outside Malaysia;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "from a place within Malaysia to a place outside Malaysia; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "from a place outside Malaysia to a place within Malaysia, and includes the provision of insurance policies to cover risks relating to the transportation of goods within Malaysia that forms part of the transportation referred to in subparagraphs (ii) and (iii) where the coverage is provided by the same person;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in relation to the provision of export credit insurance policies to local exporters, banks and investors, means where the export credit insurance policies are provided to cover risks outside Malaysia relating to the export of goods, services and investments; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in any other case, means any taxable service supplied for and to a person in a country other than Malaysia, provided that the service is not supplied in connection with goods or land situated in Malaysia and the person is not in Malaysia at the time the service is performed;'; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_3",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_3__para_c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_2__list_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(2) For the avoidance of doubt it is declared that notwithstanding subsections 1(1) and 1(1A) and without affecting section 2A, for the purposes of the definition of the expression \"exported taxable service\" Labuan, Langkawi, the Joint Development Area and the free zones shall be deemed to be places outside Malaysia.\". Amendment of section 10A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
