        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the words \"section 6(4) of the Limitation Act 1953\" the words \", section 3 of the Limitation Ordinance of Sabah or section 3 of the Limitation Ordinance of Sarawak, as the case may require,\". Amendment of section 17"
