      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for paragraph (c) the following paragraph: \"(c) a society, an association or other body of persons,\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"association of persons\" second appearing the words \"society, association or other body of persons\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_5__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"the person, company, firm or association of persons liable to pay the service tax, penalty or surcharge\" the words \"such company, firm, society, association or other body of persons\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_5__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the full stop at the end of the section a colon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_5__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting below the existing provisions the following proviso: \"Provided that in relation to a company that is being wound up, the directors of such company shall only be so liable where the assets of the company are insufficient to meet the amount due, after paying any sums having priority under the Companies Act 1965 in relation to the application of the assets of the company in such winding up over the service tax or penalty.\". Amendment of section 24"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 24 of the principal Act is amended by deleting subsections"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "(3) and (4). New section 26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 26 the following section: \" Access to 26A. (1) Any proper officer exercising his powers under recorded sections 24, 25 and 26 shall be given access to any recorded information or com- information or computerized data, whether stored in a puterized computer or otherwise. data. (2) In addition, a proper officer exercising his powers under sections 24, 25 and 26— (a) may inspect and check the operation of any computer and any associated apparatus or material which he has reasonable cause to suspect is or has been used in connection with that information or data; and (b) may require— (i) the person by whom or on whose behalf the proper officer has reasonable cause to suspect the computer is or has been so used; or (ii) the person having charge of, or is otherwise concerned with, the operation of the computer, apparatus or material, to provide him with such reasonable assistance as he may require for the purposes of this section. (3) For the purposes of subsection (1), \"access\" includes being provided with the necessary password, encryption code, decryption code, software or hardware and any other means required to enable comprehension of recorded information or computerized data.\". Amendment of section 28"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_8__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_8__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 28 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_8__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraph (c) of the proviso to subsection (1), by inserting after the words \"another female\" the words \"with strict regard to decency\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsections: \"(4) Every person so arrested may be released from custody— (a) on his depositing such reasonable sum of money as the proper officer may require; (b) on his executing a bond, with such surety or sureties, as the proper officer may require; or (c) on his depositing such reasonable sum of money as the proper officer may require and his executing a bond, with such surety or sureties as the proper officer may require. (5) Any person who has been released from custody under subsection (4) may be arrested without warrant by any proper officer— (a) if such officer has reasonable grounds for believing that any condition on or subject to which such person was released or otherwise admitted to bail has been or is likely to be breached; or (b) on being notified in writing by the surety of such person that such person is likely to breach any condition on or subject to which such person was released and that the surety wishes to be relieved of his obligation as surety.\". Amendment of section 35"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_9__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_9__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 35(1) of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_9__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"firm, society or other body of persons\" first appearing the words \"a firm, a society, an association or other body of persons\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_9__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/12/eng@/~cl_9",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"society or other body of persons\" second appearing the words \"society, association or other body of persons\". Deletion of section 36"
      }
    }
  ]
}
